                  }
                ],
                "value": "Found in the cytoplasm in unstimulated cells but is translocated to the membrane ruffles in cells stimulated with EGF (epidermal growth factor) (By similarity). Colocalizes with TESK1 in vesicular spots in the cytoplasm (PubMed:15584898)"
              }
